                                                "sense_id": "f9ce3464-cd8e-322f-a339-0fff0eee6ab9",
                                                "text": "There are, however, exceptions. Piccalilli – aka “mustard with other stuff”, aka “that noble Anglo-Indian spiritual creation” – is great with ham, he conceeds^([sic])."
